    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1018">

                <pb facs="1061" n="775" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg775"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/4134</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-14T18:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 14, 1916, 6 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 15, 7 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>142. Department’s circular telegram, October 10, 1 p. m.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1018-f1"/> Foreign war submarines prohibited entering Swedish
                    territorial waters except Öre Sund passage, or in case stress weather or
                    disablement, see Legation’s despatches 661, June 31 and 662, August 1.<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d1018-f2"/> Every submarine is treated as war submarine unless
                    commercial character proved, see Legation’s 675, September 26.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1018-f3"/> Endeavoring procure further information from Foreign
                    Office.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morris</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
